      "title": "Using Theme Data in Widgets",
      "lectureOrder": 128,
      "videoOrder": 117,
      "sourceHash": "b292310fa8f732add3836b8abf89933945afff07d8a9ffc23cafa806f51c601c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 3.93,
          "en": "So we got our theme set up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.93,
          "end": 5.91,
          "en": "And this is of course very useful",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.91,
          "end": 7.26,
          "en": "because it means that we don't have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.26,
          "end": 10.02,
          "en": "to manually override all these stylings in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.02,
          "end": 11.67,
          "en": "different parts of our app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.67,
          "end": 14.64,
          "en": "But sometimes you of course wanna override certain styles in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.64,
          "end": 19.17,
          "en": "your app, but you also at the same time might want to use,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.17,
          "end": 22.26,
          "en": "for example, colors from your main theme.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.26,
          "end": 24.45,
          "en": "And how could you do that then?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.45,
          "end": 28.23,
          "en": "Well, let's, for example, start in expense item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.23,
          "end": 32.37,
          "en": "Here, in expense item, we might want to change the look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.37,
          "end": 36.12,
          "en": "of our expense title, and for that of course we can add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.12,
          "end": 38.52,
          "en": "the style parameter to this text widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.52,
          "end": 40.59,
          "en": "as we did it before in this course as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.59,
          "end": 44.1,
          "en": "And we could manually create a text style object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.1,
          "end": 46.113,
          "en": "to set up the styling of the text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.95,
          "end": 50.52,
          "en": "But now that we learned about theming, we can also reach out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.52,
          "end": 54.813,
          "en": "to our theme stylings and apply those to this text here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.71,
          "end": 58.32,
          "en": "And to do that, we can use the theme class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.32,
          "end": 62.43,
          "en": "built into Flutter, which has a off method which needs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.43,
          "end": 64.68,
          "en": "the context as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.68,
          "end": 67.5,
          "en": "And that is a pattern we saw before with the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.5,
          "end": 69.53999999999999,
          "en": "scaffold messenger.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.53999999999999,
          "end": 73.8,
          "en": "There, we also had such an off method to basically reach out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.8,
          "end": 77.97,
          "en": "to this metadata context object managed by Flutter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.97,
          "end": 81.21000000000001,
          "en": "The theme class needs to do the same thing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.21000000000001,
          "end": 84.768,
          "en": "It is constructed by connecting it to this context object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.768,
          "end": 86.91,
          "en": "and this connection is needed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.91,
          "end": 90,
          "en": "because through that context object Flutter gets access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90,
          "end": 91.923,
          "en": "to our theme settings, basically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.82,
          "end": 96.81,
          "en": "And now on that theme class or on that theme object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.81,
          "end": 99.27000000000001,
          "en": "that was created here, we can for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.27000000000001,
          "end": 102.53999999999999,
          "en": "access the text theme property to get access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.53999999999999,
          "end": 105.12,
          "en": "to all the text themes that we set up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.12,
          "end": 107.03999999999999,
          "en": "and all the default text themes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.03999999999999,
          "end": 109.953,
          "en": "that were set up automatically that we didn't overwrite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 110.82,
          "end": 113.88,
          "en": "And then, for example, reach out to title large.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 113.88,
          "end": 117.12,
          "en": "And this will then apply the textiles that are set up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.12,
          "end": 118.65,
          "en": "for title large.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118.65,
          "end": 121.29,
          "en": "So either the default textiles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 121.29,
          "end": 124.53,
          "en": "or as in this case our own textile,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 124.53,
          "end": 126.87,
          "en": "which we set up for title large.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 126.87,
          "end": 129.51,
          "en": "And this text style will now be applied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 129.51,
          "end": 131.49,
          "en": "to this expense title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.49,
          "end": 133.98,
          "en": "And you can see this more clearly if we go back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 133.98,
          "end": 135.36,
          "en": "to the main dart file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 135.36,
          "end": 136.92000000000002,
          "en": "and we changed the font weight",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 136.92000000000002,
          "end": 140.49,
          "en": "of our title large here from normal to bold",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 140.49,
          "end": 143.313,
          "en": "and maybe increase the font size to 16.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 144.48,
          "end": 148.32,
          "en": "If we do that and force a reload, you now see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 148.32,
          "end": 151.17000000000002,
          "en": "that this title here in our expense item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 151.17000000000002,
          "end": 154.07999999999998,
          "en": "clearly is bold and has a different look.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 154.07999999999998,
          "end": 157.17000000000002,
          "en": "Please also note that it has a different color than we have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 157.17000000000002,
          "end": 159.45,
          "en": "here in the app bar, because of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 159.45,
          "end": 161.37,
          "en": "as mentioned before, in the app bar,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 161.37,
          "end": 164.22,
          "en": "we're setting a separate foreground color, whereas here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 164.22,
          "end": 167.91,
          "en": "we're setting a different general color for title large.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 167.91,
          "end": 170.57999999999998,
          "en": "And it's this color here, which is now picked up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 170.57999999999998,
          "end": 171.99,
          "en": "by expense item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 171.99,
          "end": 174.45,
          "en": "As you can again see if I change this back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 174.45,
          "end": 177.48,
          "en": "to colors red, briefly of course only.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 177.48,
          "end": 181.053,
          "en": "But if I do that, you see that now the title is indeed red.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 182.37,
          "end": 184.92,
          "en": "So that's how you can use some settings you set up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 184.92,
          "end": 188.04,
          "en": "in your general theme, in your own widgets.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 188.04,
          "end": 189.54,
          "en": "And of course here I'm switching back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 189.54,
          "end": 192.21,
          "en": "to the actual color I want to use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 192.21,
          "end": 195.18,
          "en": "So that's how we can pick up theme settings.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 195.18,
          "end": 196.86,
          "en": "Now of course here, I also wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 196.86,
          "end": 199.35,
          "en": "that this title is actually pushed all the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 199.35,
          "end": 200.57999999999998,
          "en": "way to the left here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 200.57999999999998,
          "end": 203.97,
          "en": "And to achieve this, I don't need to do any theming.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 203.97,
          "end": 205.95,
          "en": "Instead, I can simply go to this column",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 205.95,
          "end": 208.05,
          "en": "that contains my text here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 208.05,
          "end": 210.573,
          "en": "and set the cross axis alignment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 211.47,
          "end": 214.89,
          "en": "which for a column is the horizontal axis",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 214.89,
          "end": 217.44299999999998,
          "en": "to cross access alignment start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 218.49,
          "end": 221.79,
          "en": "And this will make sure that all the column items are moved",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 221.79,
          "end": 224.31,
          "en": "to the start of the column horizontally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 224.31,
          "end": 226.74,
          "en": "so to the left in this case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 226.74,
          "end": 228.57,
          "en": "So that's how we can reach out to our theme",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 228.57,
          "end": 231.57,
          "en": "to use certain values from that theme.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 231.57,
          "end": 235.35,
          "en": "But we're not limited to using text settings, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 235.35,
          "end": 239.13,
          "en": "in my expenses list, I also want to add a background color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 239.13,
          "end": 243.66,
          "en": "to this dismissible item so that as we swipe an item away,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 243.66,
          "end": 247.65,
          "en": "we actually have a little background effect that indicates",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 247.65,
          "end": 249.603,
          "en": "to us that the item will be deleted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 250.59,
          "end": 253.98,
          "en": "And this can be achieved by going to the dismissible widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 253.98,
          "end": 258.66,
          "en": "and setting the background property or parameter there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 258.66,
          "end": 261.423,
          "en": "Now the background parameter wants a widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 262.44,
          "end": 265.53,
          "en": "and for that here we could use the built-in container widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 265.53,
          "end": 268.17,
          "en": "because this widget allows us to set a lot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 268.17,
          "end": 271.02,
          "en": "of different parameters, including the color,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 271.02,
          "end": 274.35,
          "en": "which is actually the background color of the container.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 274.35,
          "end": 276.27,
          "en": "As you see here, the color it paints",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 276.27,
          "end": 278.90999999999997,
          "en": "behind a possible child widget you might",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 278.90999999999997,
          "end": 280.35,
          "en": "include in the container.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 280.35,
          "end": 283.47,
          "en": "And that therefore allows us to set up a background color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 283.47,
          "end": 285.603,
          "en": "And this of course wants a color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 286.47,
          "end": 287.90999999999997,
          "en": "Now, as before in this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 287.90999999999997,
          "end": 290.07,
          "en": "we could create a color manually here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 290.07,
          "end": 291.81,
          "en": "but now that we learned about theming,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 291.81,
          "end": 296.22,
          "en": "we can also pick a color with theme of, from our theme.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 296.22,
          "end": 299.22,
          "en": "And that allows us to pick a color that's more in line",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 299.22,
          "end": 301.143,
          "en": "with our general color scheme.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 302.37,
          "end": 304.95,
          "en": "And to do that, we can access theme of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 304.95,
          "end": 307.65,
          "en": "and then .colorScheme to get hold of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 307.65,
          "end": 311.46,
          "en": "that color scheme we set up in our main dart file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 311.46,
          "end": 315.03,
          "en": "Remember, we created this color scheme with one seed color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 315.03,
          "end": 317.58,
          "en": "Now as mentioned, this behind the scenes creates a lot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 317.58,
          "end": 320.82,
          "en": "of different shades and variations of that color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 320.82,
          "end": 323.61,
          "en": "for different aspects of the app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 323.61,
          "end": 325.59,
          "en": "And we can now use those shades",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 325.59,
          "end": 329.61,
          "en": "and variance here to access the error color,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 329.61,
          "end": 333.15,
          "en": "which is one of the automatically generated variations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 333.15,
          "end": 336.783,
          "en": "of our seed color for error scenarios.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 339.12,
          "end": 342.63,
          "en": "If I do this and I save everything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 342.63,
          "end": 346.05,
          "en": "you will see that as I swipe this item here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 346.05,
          "end": 349.47,
          "en": "I get this red background container coming in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 349.47,
          "end": 352.83,
          "en": "indicating to me that this is going to be deleted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 352.83,
          "end": 355.71,
          "en": "Of course here, we then also could apply some fine tuning",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 355.71,
          "end": 360.12,
          "en": "and for example, add a margin with edge insets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 360.12,
          "end": 365.12,
          "en": "and then use symmetric to add some horizontal margin",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 365.64,
          "end": 370.64,
          "en": "of 16 so that with that, if I force a reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 371.16,
          "end": 374.43,
          "en": "this container actually starts where the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 374.43,
          "end": 376.14300000000003,
          "en": "list item also starts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 379.17,
          "end": 380.91,
          "en": "But of course here, we would have the problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 380.91,
          "end": 384.57,
          "en": "that if we ever change the margin of the list item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 384.57,
          "end": 386.493,
          "en": "we have to change it here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 387.57,
          "end": 390.75,
          "en": "And you might remember that in main dart I actually set the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 390.75,
          "end": 394.71,
          "en": "margin of the card theme here to horizontal 16.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 394.71,
          "end": 399.063,
          "en": "So that's actually where this margin here is coming from.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 400.05,
          "end": 403.02,
          "en": "So therefore, since this is defined in our theme",
